{{Quote|I'd bet anything you're a Genry on Coruscant, which means on Shili you'd be an Ai. And on both of those worlds, that formation of blue dwarfs nearby? It gives the people born under that sign wisdom, charisma, and exceptional virility.|Amilyn Holdo, to an Imperial captain|audio=AGenryOnCourscant-LPOA.flac|<ref name="Leia" />}}
'''Shili''' was a [[planet]] located in the [[Shili system]] within the [[Expansion Region]], that was the [[homeworld]] of the [[Sentience|sentient]] [[Togruta]] [[species]].

==Description==
[[File:ShiliTrees-LaD.png|250px|left|thumb|Pine tree forests on Shili]]
Shili was a [[planet]]<ref name="Togruta" /> that was located in the [[Shili system]] in the [[Ehosiq sector]] of the [[Expansion Region]].<ref name="Appendix" /> It was the [[homeworld]] of the [[Togruta]] [[species]].<ref name="Togruta" /> Shili had [[color]]ful [[grass]]lands, expansive [[pine]] [[tree]] forests, as well as hills and mountains.<ref name="Life and Death" /> The native Togruta displayed distinctive skin patterns for camouflaging in the grasses.<ref name="Aliens of the Galaxy" />

==Culture==
[[File:ShiliVillage-LaD.png|250px|right|thumb|A [[Ahsoka Tano's village|Togruta village]] on Shili]]
Shili was known to produce famously melodramatic [[holovid]]s. One of the signs in Shili's zodiac system was called [[Ai]]. Its traits were wisdom, charisma, and exceptional virility. The constellation representing that sign was formed from [[blue dwarf]] [[star]]s. A being [[Reproduction|born]] under Ai also had the sign [[Genry]] on [[Coruscant]].<ref name="Leia" />

==History==
Shili was the homeworld of [[Jedi Master]] [[Shaak Ti]] as well as former [[Padawan]] [[Ahsoka Tano]].<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars]]''</ref> Tano would be discovered by the [[Jedi Order]] when Jedi Master [[Plo Koon]] visited the planet and noticed that Tano was [[Force-sensitive]]. Koon would subsequently bring Tano to the [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]] on [[Coruscant]] so she could begin her [[Jedi training]].<ref name="The Gathering">{{TCW|The Gathering (episode)}}</ref>

